  |- ( ( ( ( A e. RR /\ B e. RR ) /\ ( C e. RR /\ D e. RR ) ) /\ ( E e. RR /\ F e. RR ) ) -> ( ( A + ( _i x. B ) ) =/= ( C + ( _i x. D ) ) -> ( ( ( ( E + ( _i x. F ) ) - ( A + ( _i x. B ) ) ) / ( ( C + ( _i x. D ) ) - ( A + ( _i x. B ) ) ) ) e. RR <-> ( ( C - A ) x. ( F - B ) ) = ( ( E - A ) x. ( D - B ) ) ) ) )
