  |- ( ( A e. CC /\ B e. CC /\ C e. CC ) -> ( ( ( A + B ) ^ 2 ) = ( ( ( B ^ 2 ) + ( A ^ 2 ) ) - ( 2 x. C ) ) -> ( A x. B ) = -u C ) )
